# GD-10, C4-2 (round 19, writer 10): L §4.6 "A reading `after m` with m an observation or a plan is refused at
# load, which sees m's class (LOAD-ORDER)"; L §8.3 `<x> after <m>: <m> is a plan or an observation`. pay is a plan (it
# reads no place). E4_2_refused_pad_after_decision.test reads after a decision and loads.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input dom: int

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  anchor konto
  amt = 100.00 PLN
  dom = 5
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[konto] = 900.00 PLN after pay[2026-01] "s"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-01-31)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-ORDER stated[konto] after pay[2026-01]: pay[2026-01] is a plan or an observation (m.tally:27)
